# The panel's keys play notes (F3 up), at full breath; OCT- / OCT+ move them
wait 200
key 4 down
wait 30
expect top 57
expect gate 1
expect breath >98
expect level >5
expect litkeys 16
shot key_held.png
key 4 up
wait 300
expect gate 0
tap OCT+
expect par25 1
key 0 down
wait 20
expect top 65
key 0 up
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
expect par25 -1
tapkey 0
expect top 41
# no Key breath any more: the keys always play at full breath (they sense no pressure); SEQ is the Pitch pages
tap SEQ
expect view 10
expect knob1 Bend
